{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Reject invalid exporter configuration at build time**\n\nA null/blank bucket is accepted and fails only during export, where the plugin catches the failure and produces no record. Non-positive size limits also disable truncation. Validate the destination and positive limit before constructing the client, apply equivalent validation to CloudWatch Logs and Lambda log exporters, and add invalid-configuration tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7sNyhT","finding_digest":"e8a5b44aec088cacad74b5c8f27217af254f94633bd01809b417ffe58546b79c","finding_id":"arf_v1_5cs3isxmbcgkzlluwxepe4qxv4","finding_key":"insight-plugin/exporters/s3exporter.java::builder.build::required-destination-validation","identity_key":"insight-plugin/exporters/s3exporter.java::builder.build::required-destination-validation","line":136,"observation_digest":"86b39a30c2e21a5070b317d1d0048087086353484f79d0c6db06708e70fd0eea","observation_id":"aro_v1_q2zzumgc4infa4ftc7i5abeaq4","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/exporters/S3Exporter.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_5cs3isxmbcgkzlluwxepe4qxv4","published_at":"2026-09-08T23:03:39Z","review_id":"arr_v1_iee7bcnfj7lcytdfodx5mvljjs","reviewed_base_sha":"730f534832656d1da8a3205f5468595ffb05f33d","reviewed_head_sha":"ce1de5fa37a2da2f6805802585eeee8390944531","reviewer":"codex","start_line":135,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_6mz2q3ktcp4gwiziux2jfunucg","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-08T23:03:39Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
